<title>USA: Duff &amp; Phelps reaffirms American Skandia Life.</title>
<headline>Duff &amp; Phelps reaffirms American Skandia Life.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said Wednesday it reaffirmed the claims paying ability of American Skandia Life Assurance Corp at Double A Minus.</p>
<p>It said this very high claims paying ability is based on American Skandia's low-risk liability structure, adequate capital position, strong market position, excellent asset quality and the support of its ultimate parent, Skandia Insurance Co Ltd. 	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
